# Independently owned paths. The point of this file is that whoever edits the
# application cannot also relax the test that checks it, or the workflow that runs
# the gate, or the agent configuration that decides what may execute.
#
# AS-07 (SCM acceptance) is measured through this file plus branch protection:
# a candidate touching any path below must be accepted by someone other than the
# author before it lands.

# The independent authorization requirement.
/tests/                     @OWNER_PLACEHOLDER

# Executable configuration: the gate itself, and anything that runs in CI.
/.github/                   @OWNER_PLACEHOLDER
/.github/workflows/         @OWNER_PLACEHOLDER

# Agent harness configuration. A hook registered here runs with the host's identity,
# so it is reviewed like code, not like settings.
/.claude/                   @OWNER_PLACEHOLDER

# This file owns itself.
/CODEOWNERS                 @OWNER_PLACEHOLDER
